# Performance

Performance is a product feature for POS — cashiers cannot wait.

- Design for speed; do not bolt it on later.
- Avoid unnecessary re-renders. Memoize only when there is a measurable benefit.
- Fetch only required data. Prefer pagination. Use Convex indexes starting with `organizationId`.
- Keep bundles lean. Sales search, cart updates, and checkout must feel immediate.
